# systemd refuses nothing for a CRLF unit file -- it just carries the \r INTO
# the value, so Environment="PATH=/usr/bin\r" silently breaks every lookup.
# The repo has core.autocrlf=true on the Windows box these were written on, so
# say it explicitly rather than rely on the default.
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer   text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
